<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-11-14T12:04:28+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:04:28 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['Daro mat': BJP demands return of 51 cartons of Nehru's letters, including those to Edwina Mountbatten]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/daro-mat-bjp-demands-return-of-51-cartons-of-nehrus-letters-including-those-to-edwina-mountbatten/articleshow/135823429.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135823429.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP has called for the return of 51 cartons of documents belonging to Jawaharlal Nehru. The documents were allegedly taken by Sonia Gandhi in 2008 while the UPA was in power. BJP spokesperson CR Kesavan emphasized the importance of these letters for India's heritage and research. Rahul Gandhi and other Congress leaders paid tribute to Nehru on his birthday, highlighting his contributions to the nation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/daro-mat-bjp-demands-return-of-51-cartons-of-nehrus-letters-including-those-to-edwina-mountbatten/articleshow/135823429.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/daro-mat-bjp-demands-return-of-51-cartons-of-nehrus-letters-including-those-to-edwina-mountbatten/articleshow/135823429.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T11:45:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135824783,imgsize-100038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[AIIMS plans national registry to track poisoning cases]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiims-plans-national-registry-to-track-poisoning-cases/articleshow/135824411.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135824411.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[AIIMS New Delhi is taking significant steps towards public health by launching a National Poisoning Registry designed to monitor poisoning incidents across the country. The registry will facilitate real-time data sharing among poison-control centers, enabling swifter emergency responses. Additionally, plans involve establishing a national antidote bank, fostering toxicology research, and initiating poison awareness programs in communities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiims-plans-national-registry-to-track-poisoning-cases/articleshow/135824411.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiims-plans-national-registry-to-track-poisoning-cases/articleshow/135824411.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T11:30:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135824491,imgsize-150179.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mahadev betting app: CBI raids 33 locations across six states after Chandrakar's extradition]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mahadev-betting-app-cbi-raids-33-locations-across-six-states-after-chandrakars-extradition/articleshow/135821960.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135821960.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mahadev-betting-app-cbi-raids-33-locations-across-six-states-after-chandrakars-extradition/articleshow/135821960.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mahadev-betting-app-cbi-raids-33-locations-across-six-states-after-chandrakars-extradition/articleshow/135821960.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T10:20:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Raj Shekhar Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135823105,imgsize-64558.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Chhath Puja not drama': BJP rakes up year-old video to target Rahul Gandhi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/chhath-puja-not-drama-bjp-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-disrespecting-hindu-festivals/articleshow/135822703.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135822703.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP leader Pradeep Bhandari on Saturday targeted Congress leader Rahul Gandhi over his year-old remarks on Prime Minister Narendra Modi and Chhath Puja, demanding a public apology for allegedly calling the festival "drama". Bhandari questioned the Congress's respect for Hindu sentiments. The attack came amid Chhath celebrations and a day after MNS chief Raj Thackeray accused the BJP of "divide and rule" over the festival.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/chhath-puja-not-drama-bjp-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-disrespecting-hindu-festivals/articleshow/135822703.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/chhath-puja-not-drama-bjp-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-disrespecting-hindu-festivals/articleshow/135822703.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T10:02:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135822800,imgsize-1185295.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Jewel of India': PM Modi, Rahul Gandhi, Rajnath Singh pay tributes to Nehru on birth anniversary]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jewel-of-india-pm-modi-rahul-gandhi-rajnath-singh-pay-tribute-to-jawaharlal-nehru/articleshow/135822093.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135822093.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jewel-of-india-pm-modi-rahul-gandhi-rajnath-singh-pay-tribute-to-jawaharlal-nehru/articleshow/135822093.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jewel-of-india-pm-modi-rahul-gandhi-rajnath-singh-pay-tribute-to-jawaharlal-nehru/articleshow/135822093.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T09:35:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135822309,imgsize-524132.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1 stenographer, 4,500 cases: HC seeks explanation over delay in pronouncing order]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/1-stenographer-4500-cases-hc-seeks-explanation-over-delay-in-pronouncing-order/articleshow/135816096.cms"&gt;&l